# Release signing (R1b). The private key must never enter this repository.
#
# Listed here and not only in docs/release-signing.md because an ignore rule is
# the only form of that instruction git itself enforces. `git stash -u` takes
# untracked files but leaves ignored ones alone, and that difference is not
# hypothetical: preparing v0.9.0rc4, a `git stash -u` run in this directory
# pulled fabric-release.key into a stash entry -- a private key inside .git,
# from a command whose purpose was to move a version bump out of the way.
#
# `git stash -a` ignores this list. Do not use it here.
fabric-release.key
*.key
candidate.bin
candidate.sig
candidate-*.bin
candidate-*.sig
